# What ThreadSanitizer reports inside the libraries the engine is built from (suppressions=, see
# run_tests.sh). One line per finding, with why. A finding in the engine's own code is fixed; the
# only ones listed here are known and waiting for their fix, each saying so.

# KNOWN, TO FIX in src/physics (left to the work going on there): World::attach_vehicle holds a
# body's write lock while it adds a step listener (Jolt's listener mutex), and PhysicsSystem::Update
# takes them the other way round. Physics runs on one thread, so they never meet today; two
# threads adding vehicles and stepping at once would deadlock.
deadlock:redgem::jolt::World::attach_vehicle
